{"id":3665,"date":"2024-12-01T09:11:28","date_gmt":"2024-12-01T01:11:28","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3665"},"modified":"2024-12-01T09:15:37","modified_gmt":"2024-12-01T01:15:37","slug":"filament-polyester-air-slide-fabric","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=filament-polyester-air-slide-fabric","title":{"rendered":"Filament Polyester Air Slide Fabric"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"product-post\" data-elementor-id=\"3665\" class=\"elementor elementor-3665\" data-elementor-post-type=\"product\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afd2df3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"afd2df3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26c851b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"26c851b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Air slide Fabrics are air permeable fabrics used in air activated conveyors or bin\/silo aerators for the conveyance of dry bulk powders. It is also be called air slide belt, air slide cloth, air slide canvas, air slide membrane. Polyester conveyor belts can be used in a variety of harsh environmental conditions, including high temperatures, moisture and chemically corrosive environments. Because the polyester conveyor belt material has a low friction coefficient and good wear resistance, it is suitable for conveying large quantities of materials at high speeds.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79a54d6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"79a54d6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6ca3bf elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f6ca3bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-04-detail1_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3671\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-04-detail1_syy.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-04-detail1_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-04-detail1_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-09b3b4a elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"09b3b4a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-05-detail2_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3672\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-05-detail2_syy.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-05-detail2_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-05-detail2_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58d94d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"58d94d3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our fabrics can be used at temperatures between -60\u00b0C and +150\u00b0C. The airslide fabrics are made from polyester yarns. We are also, however, able to weave fabrics to our customers\u2019 specific demands for air permeability and mechanical strength.<\/p><h3>Air Slide System<\/h3><p>Air slide fabrics use gravity to do most of the work without any moving parts, by tilting the air conveyor to flow the powder material, which flows through the porous media under the influence of low-pressure air. Air slide systems provide high-volume material handling with extremely low energy requirements because only small amounts of low-pressure air are required to move the material.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc15a68 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"dc15a68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"542\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/air-slide-system-detail3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3673\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/air-slide-system-detail3.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/air-slide-system-detail3-300x217.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/air-slide-system-detail3-600x434.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e4465e elementor-widget elemen