king it easy to clean and maintain, reducing downtime and maintenance costs.<\/li><li>Economy: It has a lower cost and is more economical than conveyor belts made of other materials.<\/li><\/ul><h3>Applications of Polyester Air Slide Fabric:<\/h3><p>The design of polyester air-slip fabrics usually takes into account the characteristics of the material and the needs of the conveying system, and can be customized into different sizes, structures and surface properties to meet the needs of different industries and applications. They are widely used in production and transportation processes in various fields such as food processing, mining, chemicals, logistics, and construction materials.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Power Stations<\/strong>: Filtered dust, flue ash, discharging flue ash, coal dust, etc.<\/li><li><strong>Building and Construction<\/strong>: Cement, furnace dust, gypsum, limestone, finely ground quartz, calcium hydroxide, lead monoxide, quicklime, acid crystals, Pure clay, phosphates, magnesite concentrate, finely ground<br \/>fluorid, production of aluminum, etc.<\/li><li><strong>Chemical Industry<\/strong>\u00a0: Fertilizer, rubber compounds, sinter dust, catalysts, sodium sulfate, soap powder, etc.<\/li><li><strong>Silos\/Tanks<\/strong>: Discharging systems, warehouse units, mixing equipment, Homogenizing systems.<\/li><li><strong>Chute Bottoms<\/strong>: Conveyor systems, ventilator systems, aeration systems.<\/li><li><strong>Vehicles:<\/strong>\u00a0Silo truck discharging cones, railway wagon discharging cones, vessel aeration &amp; discharging bottoms, container aeration &amp; discharging bottoms.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Polyester air slide fabric is a common industrial conveyor belt commonly used to transport various types of materials and products. It is made of polyester fiber, which has properties such as wear resistance, corrosion resistance